xfce4-mediaplayer-plugin (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Give album art and the progress/time indicator their own grace
    period on a momentary MPRIS metadata gap, independent of the
    track text's, so neither flashes empty during track changes.
  * Fix the progress bar's theme coloring so the fill has real
    contrast against both light and dark panels.
  * Hide the progress bar immediately when disabled in preferences,
    instead of after a few seconds.
  * Add click-to-play/pause on the track text and an enlarged album
    art preview on hover.

